const CX_G=[['all','✨','ทั้งหมด','All'],['pow','⚔️','พลัง','Power'],['beast','🐾','สัตว์อสูร','Beasts'],['place','🏯','สังกัด/ดินแดน','Places'],['other','🌌','ต่างโลก','Otherworld'],['item','🎒','ข้าวของ','Items']];
function openCodex(g,q){const C=cdx(),en=LANG==='en';g=g||openCodex._g||'all';openCodex._g=g;q=q==null?(openCodex._q||''):q;openCodex._q=q;
 const cats=cxCats(),has=(c,id)=>!!(C[c]&&C[c][id]);let got=0,tot=0;const gc={};
 cats.forEach(c=>{const n=c.L.filter(([id])=>has(c.cat,id)).length;c.got=n;got+=n;tot+=c.L.length;const o=gc[c.g]=gc[c.g]||[0,0];o[0]+=n;o[1]+=c.L.length});gc.all=[got,tot];
 const pc=x=>tot?Math.round(x*100):0,ql=q.trim().toLowerCase();
 const tabs=CX_G.map(([k,ic,t,te])=>`<button class="cxtab ${k===g?'on':''}" onclick="openCodex('${k}')">${ic} ${en?te:t}<em>${(gc[k]||[0,0])[0]}/${(gc[k]||[0,0])[1]}</em></button>`).join('');
 const vis=cats.filter(c=>g==='all'||c.g===g);
 const body=vis.map(c=>{let L=c.L;const hit=ql?L.filter(([id,n])=>has(c.cat,id)&&(n.toLowerCase().includes(ql)||tEN(n).toLowerCase().includes(ql))):null;if(ql&&!hit.length)return'';
  const p=c.L.length?c.got/c.L.length:0,done=c.got===c.L.length;
  const chips=L.map(([id,n,rare])=>has(c.cat,id)?`<span class="cxp${rare?' rare':''}${hit&&hit.some(h=>h[0]===id)?' hit':''}">${esc(n)}</span>`:'<span class="cxp lk">???</span>').join('');
  return`<details class="cxc"${ql?' open':''}><summary><span class="cxic">${c.ic}</span><span class="cxt"><b>${en?c.te:c.t}</b><div class="cxbar"><i style="width:${p*100}%"></i></div></span><span class="cxn${done?' done':''}">${done?'✓ ':''}${c.got}/${c.L.length}</span></summary><div class="cxg">${chips}</div></details>`}).join('')||`<div class="cxempty">${en?'Nothing found yet':'ยังไม่พบสิ่งที่ค้นหา'}</div>`;
 const rk=got/tot>=1?(en?'Master of All Records':'ปราชญ์ผู้รู้แจ้งทุกสิ่ง'):got/tot>=.75?(en?'Grand Scholar':'มหาบัณฑิต'):got/tot>=.5?(en?'Scholar':'บัณฑิต'):got/tot>=.25?(en?'Wanderer':'ผู้ท่องโลก'):(en?'Novice':'ผู้เริ่มสำรวจ');
 modal(`<button class="xbtn" onclick="closeM()">✕</button><h3>📚 ${en?'Codex':'สารานุกรม'}</h3>
 <div class="cxh"><div class="big">${pc(got/tot)}%<small>${got}/${tot}</small></div><div class="sub">🏅 ${rk} · ${en?'Entries unlock the first time you meet them in any life':'ปลดล็อกเมื่อเจอครั้งแรกในชีวิตใดก็ได้'}</div><div class="cxbar"><i style="width:${got/tot*100}%"></i></div></div>
 <div class="cxtabs">${tabs}</div>
 <input class="cxsr" id="cxSr" placeholder="🔎 ${en?'Search discovered entries…':'ค้นหาสิ่งที่ค้นพบแล้ว…'}" value="${esc(q)}" oninput="clearTimeout(openCodex._t);openCodex._t=setTimeout(()=>{openCodex(null,this.value);const e=$('cxSr');if(e){e.focus();e.setSelectionRange(e.value.length,e.value.length)}},250)">
 <div class="cxbody">${body}</div>`,'codex')}
